; --- 37A: the deed post for the Ashfall Cottage -------------------------------
; Moved in 37D from (-6, -14) — a post in the middle of the square selling a house nobody could see —
; to just outside its own doorway. It stays OUTSIDE the room: a deed a non-owner cannot walk up to is
; a deed nobody can buy. The holding it sells is data/properties/EmberCrownCottage.tres, and the
; travel node it registers on a claim is recorded at the PLAYER's position, not this post's — landing
; fast travel on a collider is a trap TravelNodeComponent already paid for once, and standing at the
; post puts that landing point in the open ground north of the door.

[node name="CottageDeed" type="Node3D" parent="."]
